    "created_at": "2016-07-13T23:33:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T23:33:08Z",
    "body": "IMHO, what Firefox does currently is probably what we should spec: during animations `-webkit-background-clip: text` is not applied, `-webkit-text-color` is be showed instead. Arguably Chrome and Safari's non-:hover behaviors in this TC are buggy -- but the animated text part agreees with Firefox.\n",
